### Send guest order tracking OTP
POST http://localhost:5000/api/guest-orders/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "guest@example.com"
}

### Verify guest order tracking OTP
POST http://localhost:5000/api/guest-orders/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "guest@example.com",
  "otp": "123456"
}

### Fetch all guest orders after OTP verification
GET http://localhost:5000/api/guest-orders/my-orders
Authorization: Bearer {{trackingToken}}

### Fetch safe tracking details for one owned order
GET http://localhost:5000/api/guest-orders/track/ORD12345
Authorization: Bearer {{trackingToken}}

### Negative: order number alone must not expose details
GET http://localhost:5000/api/guest-orders/track/ORD12345

### Negative: unknown contact should receive only a generic send-otp response
POST http://localhost:5000/api/guest-orders/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "wrong@example.com"
}
